    <briefdescription>
<para>Contains two maps which aid in option parsing. The first map, <ref refid="structargagg_1_1parser__map_1af2ace0b7403a1302566719ea2b97baad" kindref="member">short_map</ref>, maps from a short flag (just a character) to a pointer to the original <ref refid="structargagg_1_1definition" kindref="compound">definition</ref> that the flag represents. The second map, <ref refid="structargagg_1_1parser__map_1a5ed8cd6a5e57925359d33e9472773d49" kindref="member">long_map</ref>, maps from a long flag (an <ref refid="cpp/string/basic_string" kindref="compound" external="/home/cim/pgr/pmai286/blacksmith/build-vg/_deps/argagg-src/doc/cppreference-doxygen-web.tag.xml">std::string</ref>) to a pointer to the original <ref refid="structargagg_1_1definition" kindref="compound">definition</ref> that the flag represents. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This object is usually a temporary that only exists during the parsing operation. It is typically constructed using <ref refid="namespaceargagg_1a7a7eacb2cf495cc33c08df68619fbf95" kindref="member">validate_definitions()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
